				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>A </grad><grad from=#E29AD2 to=#FFDCF5 f=0.8>Gambler's Ring</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 是 Luck III，能将你的幸运度提升至 50%。它也是制作 </grad><grad from=#E29AD2 to=#FFDCF5 f=0.8>Gambler's Blade</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和 </grad><grad from=#E29AD2 to=#FFDCF5 f=0.8>Target Cube</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的原料。</grad></shadow>"
